section=f'''<section id="month-codewords"><p class="eyebrow">Follow-up · shuffled month codewords</p><h2>Does the effect survive a new answer vocabulary?</h2><p>Two of five shuffled chat codebooks pass both native ordinal/codeword checks. T2375 activates at two prefix newline positions for the eleventh-month prompts, but removing both contributions keeps the correct codeword in both cases. The original short raw-completion November → December initial-answer shift is reproduced. Matched month-name chat controls also remain unchanged, so this is not a codeword-specific difference.</p><p><a href="../2026-11-12-month-codewords/">Prompts, heatmaps, native/gate-off responses and probabilities →</a></p></section>'''
(OUT/'section.html').write_text(section+'\n')
